values ('dialog_mq_quiet_cloth_on_crystal', 'mq_quiet_cloth_on_crystal', 'npc_mystery_iren_saye', 'greeting', '[{"id": "greeting", "text": "Someone softened this note. Before we call it vandalism or a miracle, let''s hear what they changed.", "options": [{"text": "Show me what the evidence actually says.", "next": "evidence", "action": ""}, {"text": "Who pays the cost of our decision?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "evidence", "text": "Cloth touches the fourth rib at a vibration point. The trace records lower amplitude, not a new word. The cloth''s wear suggests repeated maintenance.", "options": [{"text": "What are our options?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will investigate.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will return later.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "decision", "text": "A cloth-wrapped rib sounds different from its neighbors. Iren asks whether deliberate damping was care, damage, or concealment.", "options": [{"text": "Keep the damping while measuring", "next": "choice_1", "action": ""}, {"text": "Remove it briefly with consent", "next": "choice_2", "action": ""}, {"text": "Make a nonintrusive external trace", "next": "choice_3", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will not decide yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_1", "text": "If we choose that: The caretaker''s intervention stays intact. The cost is clear: The unwrapped tone remains untested.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_2", "text": "If we choose that: A limited comparison is recorded. The cost is clear: The louder tone may disturb visitors.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_3", "text": "If we choose that: The study avoids changing the rib. The cost is clear: The result has more uncertainty.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "accept", "text": "Keep these points separate: Recover the Cloth-Bound Resonance Trace from Quiet Gallery Rift Beast in Quiet Resonator Gallery. Examine Wrapped Resonator Rib and compare its evidence. Examine Drainage Listening Bench and compare its evidence. Discuss your finding with Iren Saye in Quiet Resonator Gallery.", "options": [{"text": "Begin this investigation.", "next": "exit", "action": "accept_quest"}, {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "exit", "text": "You may return without losing your place in the investigation.", "options": []}]'::jsonb, 'dialog_quests.json', 843)
