values ('dialog_mq_quiet_bench_wrong_way', 'mq_quiet_bench_wrong_way', 'npc_mystery_iren_saye', 'greeting', '[{"id": "greeting", "text": "The view is terrible. The listening position is excellent. Whoever sat here knew the difference.", "options": [{"text": "Show me what the evidence actually says.", "next": "evidence", "action": ""}, {"text": "Who pays the cost of our decision?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "evidence", "text": "The bench faces the drainage channel. A delayed note is loudest near its opening. The rib-facing seat receives the first note but not the delay clearly.", "options": [{"text": "What are our options?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will investigate.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will return later.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "decision", "text": "A listening bench faces a drain instead of the crystals. Its placement suggests the apparent reply has a second path.", "options": [{"text": "Mark the reflection path publicly", "next": "choice_1", "action": ""}, {"text": "Discuss it with the oral custodians first", "next": "choice_2", "action": ""}, {"text": "Publish the measurement without a verdict", "next": "choice_3", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will not decide yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_1", "text": "If we choose that: Visitors can compare both listening positions. The cost is clear: A cherished interpretation may be challenged.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_2", "text": "If we choose that: The explanation begins with the people who preserve the account. The cost is clear: Public correction waits.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_3", "text": "If we choose that: The record separates timing from claims about a voice. The cost is clear: Readers may still overinterpret it.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "accept", "text": "Keep these points separate: Examine Wrapped Resonator Rib and compare its evidence. Examine Drainage Listening Bench and compare its evidence. Discuss your finding with Iren Saye in Quiet Resonator Gallery.", "options": [{"text": "Begin this investigation.", "next": "exit", "action": "accept_quest"}, {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "exit", "text": "You may return without losing your place in the investigation.", "options": []}]'::jsonb, 'dialog_quests.json', 844)
