values ('dialog_mq_quiet_test_without_beast', 'mq_quiet_test_without_beast', 'npc_mystery_iren_saye', 'greeting', '[{"id": "greeting", "text": "It''s defending a nest. That doesn''t make it a prophet. Clear the unsafe channel; don''t write a revelation into the claws.", "options": [{"text": "Show me what the evidence actually says.", "next": "evidence", "action": ""}, {"text": "Who pays the cost of our decision?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "evidence", "text": "Claw marks reach nesting debris in the channel. The interference follows movement, not the rib''s note. The undisturbed trace still shows a reflection delay.", "options": [{"text": "What are our options?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will investigate.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will return later.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "decision", "text": "A rift beast blocks the listening channel. Iren needs a safe test environment, not a ritual victory.", "options": [{"text": "Limit future tests to a marked safe interval", "next": "choice_1", "action": ""}, {"text": "Move observers to the outer bench", "next": "choice_2", "action": ""}, {"text": "Suspend invasive testing", "next": "choice_3", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will not decide yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_1", "text": "If we choose that: The gallery receives a bounded test schedule. The cost is clear: The study collects fewer samples.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_2", "text": "If we choose that: The risky channel no longer hosts visitors. The cost is clear: Measurements become less precise.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_3", "text": "If we choose that: Iren keeps the known result without expanding the disturbance. The cost is clear: The cause remains less fully characterized.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "accept", "text": "Keep these points separate: Stop the dangerous Quiet Gallery Rift Beast in Quiet Resonator Gallery. Inspect the now-safe evidence area in Quiet Resonator Gallery. Examine Wrapped Resonator Rib and compare its evidence. Examine Drainage Listening Bench and compare its evidence. Discuss your finding with Iren Saye in Quiet Resonator Gallery.", "options": [{"text": "Begin this investigation.", "next": "exit", "action": "accept_quest"}, {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "exit", "text": "You may return without losing your place in the investigation.", "options": []}]'::jsonb, 'dialog_quests.json', 845)
