values ('dialog_mq_quiet_silence_kept', 'mq_quiet_silence_kept', 'npc_mystery_iren_saye', 'greeting', '[{"id": "greeting", "text": "I came for a complete explanation. I can leave with a careful one. Who should hold the next permission slip?", "options": [{"text": "Show me what the evidence actually says.", "next": "evidence", "action": ""}, {"text": "Who pays the cost of our decision?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "evidence", "text": "The cloth is a physical intervention. The bench reveals a reflection path. The repeated interval supports a limited finding, not an account of Shard intention.", "options": [{"text": "What are our options?", "next": "decision", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will investigate.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will return later.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "decision", "text": "The gallery can become a public experiment, a conserved listening place, or a jointly stewarded archive. Iren asks who may decide its next use.", "options": [{"text": "Conserve it as a listening place", "next": "choice_1", "action": ""}, {"text": "Permit supervised public comparisons", "next": "choice_2", "action": ""}, {"text": "Create a jointly governed evidence archive", "next": "choice_3", "action": ""}, {"text": "I will not decide yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_1", "text": "If we choose that: The bench and wrapping remain undisturbed. The cost is clear: New experiments become exceptional.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_2", "text": "If we choose that: Visitors may hear the measured effect for themselves. The cost is clear: Custodians must manage visitor pressure.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "choice_3", "text": "If we choose that: The traces remain available under shared permission. The cost is clear: Neither group has unilateral authority.", "options": [{"text": "I will verify the evidence first.", "next": "accept", "action": ""}, {"text": "I need more time.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "accept", "text": "Keep these points separate: Examine Wrapped Resonator Rib and compare its evidence. Examine Drainage Listening Bench and compare its evidence. Discuss your finding with Iren Saye in Quiet Resonator Gallery.", "options": [{"text": "Begin this investigation.", "next": "exit", "action": "accept_quest"}, {"text": "Not yet.", "next": "exit", "action": "exit"}]}, {"id": "exit", "text": "You may return without losing your place in the investigation.", "options": []}]'::jsonb, 'dialog_quests.json', 847)
